{"des":"皮塔-你怎么笑的这么吓人？","script":"sj_014_03","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara014_1","mirrow":false,"x":426,"trans":true,"y":-34,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara014_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":426,"trans":true,"y":-34,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]哦！老大，早啊！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]我在想，老大的营地设计的太合理，反而缺少了一些趣味性。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]是啊，趣味性可是重要的生活调剂！尤其对我们山狐族来说，生活缺少了趣味可是活不下去的！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]你说举几个例子？嗯，倒是能想到几个。比如……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]在营地门口设置踏板陷阱，如果进入的方式不对，就会被踏板弹飞出去！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]在仓库中放一个看起来最华丽的箱子，一旦打开箱子就会触发机关，被木棍敲中后脑勺之后用网把人收进箱子里之类！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]恐怖？有什么恐怖的？你说万一出远门回来看到箱子里有个人，怪惊悚的？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]但很有趣不是吗？嘿嘿，而且还有实用性！啊，你问我有没有做过这样的陷阱？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]呃，因为大姐头不是很那种喜欢阴险招数，所以我也没什么机会去实践。但陷阱这种东西，当然是越往“有趣”的方向设计才越令坏人胆寒啊。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]虽然有点可怕，但这和你们工匠设计新装置的时候感觉差不多？嘿嘿嘿，不愧是老大，就说我们是同道中人啦！[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara014_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":426,"trans":true,"y":-34,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}